            "id": "https://dmdh.me/zhou-ji-or20260921-0927/",
            "url": "https://dmdh.me/zhou-ji-or20260921-0927/",
            "title": "周记",
            "summary": "<p>九月将尽。这一周，我做了许多事情，今天一并记录下来。</p>\n",
            "content_html": "<p>九月将尽。这一周，我做了许多事情，今天一并记录下来。</p>\n\n<h2>项目</h2>\n<p>本周重度使用 OpenCode，做了一些自己觉得有意思的东西，首先是两个电脑软件：</p>\n<div class=\"dmdh-project-grid\"><a class=\"dmdh-project-card\" href=\"https://github.com/dmdh1145/aira\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<div class=\"dmdh-project-top\"><strong>Aira</strong> ↗</div>\n<p>A macOS AI client for OpenAI-compatible APIs.</p>\n<div class=\"dmdh-project-bottom\">Swift · macOS<span class=\"dmdh-project-status\"> <i></i> Active </span></div>\n</a> <a class=\"dmdh-project-card\" href=\"https://github.com/dmdh1145/DmDh-Tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<div class=\"dmdh-project-top\"><strong>DmDh-Tools</strong> ↗</div>\n<p>A Windows utility suite with website monitoring and an OpenCode GUI.</p>\n<div class=\"dmdh-project-bottom\">Python · PySide · Windows<span class=\"dmdh-project-status\"> <i></i> Active </span></div>\n</a></div>\n<h4><a href=\"https://dmdh.space/aira\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Aira</a></h4>\n<p>我自认为这个名字起得很好，有着 Air，AI，与 “爱” 三层含义。Aira 是一款 macOS 轻量 AI 对话软件，广泛兼容各品牌的 AI API，使用 SwiftUI 编写，支持导入 API、流式对话、思考以及思考深度的调节、Markdown 格式、网页访问 / 连网搜索、长期记忆等功能。软件轻量、简洁、原生，是我目前比较完整的项目。</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/Snipaste_2026-09-26_01-18-34.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"608\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1500px) calc(7.87vw + 610px), (min-width: 900px) calc(44.48vw + 68px), (min-width: 780px) calc(8vw + 604px), calc(84.35vw + 23px)\" srcset=\"https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/responsive/Snipaste_2026-09-26_01-18-34-xs.png 300w ,https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/responsive/Snipaste_2026-09-26_01-18-34-sm.png 480w ,https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/responsive/Snipaste_2026-09-26_01-18-34-md.png 768w\"></figure>\n<h4><a href=\"https://dmdh.space/dmdh-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DmDh-Tools</a></h4>\n<p>原本是为自己网站做的简易后台软件，后来逐渐优化，也做了发行版本出来。这是一款运行在 Windows 上的工具软件，使用 Python 和 PySide 开发，主要包含网站状态监测和 OpenCode GUI 两大功能，旨在把一些日常使用的小工具集中起来，提供一个简单、方便的桌面使用体验。</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/screenshot-status-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"780\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1500px) calc(7.87vw + 610px), (min-width: 900px) calc(44.48vw + 68px), (min-width: 780px) calc(8vw + 604px), calc(84.35vw + 23px)\" srcset=\"https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/responsive/screenshot-status-2-xs.png 300w ,https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/responsive/screenshot-status-2-sm.png 480w ,https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/responsive/screenshot-status-2-md.png 768w\"></figure>\n<p>以及这几个网站：</p>\n<h4><a href=\"https://dmdh.space\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">dmdh.space</a></h4>\n<p>为该站做了一些布局优化，并将上文的两个项目放至 {Projects} 栏内展示。</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/Snipaste_2026-09-26_01-26-13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1355\" height=\"740\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1500px) calc(7.87vw + 610px), (min-width: 900px) calc(44.48vw + 68px), (min-width: 780px) calc(8vw + 604px), calc(84.35vw + 23px)\" srcset=\"https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/responsive/Snipaste_2026-09-26_01-26-13-xs.png 300w ,https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/responsive/Snipaste_2026-09-26_01-26-13-sm.png 480w ,https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/responsive/Snipaste_2026-09-26_01-26-13-md.png 768w\"></figure>\n<h4><a href=\"https://dmdh.uno\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">dmdh.uno</a></h4>\n<p>花半小时做了个飞机大战出来，当然这不是最终成品。未来这里估计会是一个导航站，索引我那些稀奇古怪的东西。</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/Snipaste_2026-09-26_01-29-45.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1355\" height=\"738\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1500px) calc(7.87vw + 610px), (min-width: 900px) calc(44.48vw + 68px), (min-width: 780px) calc(8vw + 604px), calc(84.35vw + 23px)\" srcset=\"https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/responsive/Snipaste_2026-09-26_01-29-45-xs.png 300w ,https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/responsive/Snipaste_2026-09-26_01-29-45-sm.png 480w ,https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/responsive/Snipaste_2026-09-26_01-29-45-md.png 768w\"></figure>\n<h4><a href=\"https://wakana.dmdh.uno\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">wakana.dmdh.uno</a></h4>\n<p>和奏！我做了她的个人页！</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/Snipaste_2026-09-26_01-32-22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1355\" height=\"739\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1500px) calc(7.87vw + 610px), (min-width: 900px) calc(44.48vw + 68px), (min-width: 780px) calc(8vw + 604px), calc(84.35vw + 23px)\" srcset=\"https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/responsive/Snipaste_2026-09-26_01-32-22-xs.png 300w ,https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/responsive/Snipaste_2026-09-26_01-32-22-sm.png 480w ,https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/responsive/Snipaste_2026-09-26_01-32-22-md.png 768w\"></figure>\n<p>是非常好的 FanMade 页呢...</p>\n<h2>摄影</h2>\n<p>前几天买了一支腾龙的 70-300mm 镜头，弥补了自己 Z 卡口镜头群的空缺。</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/Wei-Xin-Tu-Pian_2026-09-26_014235_156.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1920\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1500px) calc(7.87vw + 610px), (min-width: 900px) calc(44.48vw + 68px), (min-width: 780px) calc(8vw + 604px), calc(84.35vw + 23px)\" srcset=\"https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/responsive/Wei-Xin-Tu-Pian_2026-09-26_014235_156-xs.jpg 300w ,https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/responsive/Wei-Xin-Tu-Pian_2026-09-26_014235_156-sm.jpg 480w ,https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/responsive/Wei-Xin-Tu-Pian_2026-09-26_014235_156-md.jpg 768w\"></figure>\n<p>附上几张样片，可点开放大查看：</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"添加图片\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/gallery/Wei-Xin-Tu-Pian_20260926014440_241_37.jpg\" data-size=\"1663x1109\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/gallery/Wei-Xin-Tu-Pian_20260926014440_241_37-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/gallery/Wei-Xin-Tu-Pian_20260926014445_242_37.jpg\" data-size=\"6016x4016\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/gallery/Wei-Xin-Tu-Pian_20260926014445_242_37-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"513\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/gallery/Wei-Xin-Tu-Pian_20260926014447_243_37.jpg\" data-size=\"6016x4016\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://dmdh.me/media/posts/12/gallery/Wei-Xin-Tu-Pian_20260926014447_243_37-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"513\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p>这几张就不放到 <a href=\"https://dmdh.me/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Gallery</a> 里了。</p>\n<h2>游戏</h2>\n<p>一直在玩 CS2，一天不玩浑身难受。最近迷上了手枪死斗，usp 和双枪尤其爽，开始研究枪皮和印花。每周掉落的箱子开出了个粉色品质的 ump，挺好。也推了会 ATRI。</p>\n<div><hr></div>\n<div>生活还在继续...</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div style=\"max-width: 330px;\"><div class=\"post__iframe\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100%\" height=\"86\" frameborder=\"no\" border=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" src=\"https://music.163.com/outchain/player?type=2&amp;id=34324542&amp;auto=0&amp;height=66\">\n  </iframe></div></div>\n<p class=\"msg--highlight\"><em>注：点击棕色链接，即可跳转至对应页面。</em></p>",
