        {
            "id": "https://dmdh.me/jie-yi-pian-ying-yu-zhou-jiji-lu-wo-zui-jin-zhe-teng-de-ai/",
            "url": "https://dmdh.me/jie-yi-pian-ying-yu-zhou-jiji-lu-wo-zui-jin-zhe-teng-de-ai/",
            "title": "借一篇英语周记，记录我最近折腾的AI",
            "summary": "<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">其实，这篇周记是新学期的一项英语作业。</p>\n<p>说是周记，其实也没什么特别的要求。写写这一周发生了什么，最近在做些什么，或者只是记录一点自己的想法，都可以。</p>\n",
            "content_html": "<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">其实，这篇周记是新学期的一项英语作业。</p>\n<p>说是周记，其实也没什么特别的要求。写写这一周发生了什么，最近在做些什么，或者只是记录一点自己的想法，都可以。</p>\n\n<p>我想了想，这周倒也没有什么特别值得一提的大事。不过，如果说最近我一直在折腾些什么，那应该是 AI 了。这段时间，我又重拾了部分编程本事，也开始试着用 AI 做一些诸如网站界面、工具箱一类的小东西。</p>\n<p>所以，这次的英语周记，我决定就写这个。</p>\n<blockquote translate=\"no\">\n<h3>My Week with AI</h3>\n<p>This week, I spent some of my free time playing with AI. As you know, I really like trying interesting things. So, I recently tried something new called “vibe coding”.</p>\n<p>You may have a question: What is \"vibe coding\"?</p>\n<p>It is a way of using AI to help with coding. Instead of writing everything by myself, I can just tell AI what I want to make, and it helps me create it. I tried doing this with DeepSeek, and I found it really interesting.</p>\n<p>I used it to make some small things and improve my own website. Of course, it didn’t always work perfectly. Sometimes I had to change my ideas or ask it to fix some problems. But I actually enjoyed this process.</p>\n<p>A few weeks ago, I created my own website, “dmdh.me”. It's a personal blog site. I use it to write something I like, record some of my ideas, and share things I've made. Recently, I also started thinking about how to make it better with the help of AI.</p>\n<p>I really like the feeling of seeing my ideas become real in a short time. I wasn’t simply asking AI for answers. I was trying things, making mistakes, and finding ways to improve them. Nowadays, AI has almost become my agent, my copilot and my good teacher.</p>\n<p>I’m still learning about programming, so there are many things I don’t understand yet. But I think it's OK. I’m curious, and I like learning things by trying them myself.</p>\n<p>That’s probably what I enjoyed most this week. I learned something new, made something interesting, and had a lot of fun.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://dmdh.me/media/posts/11/Snipaste_2026-09-13_04-13-42.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"260\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1500px) calc(7.87vw + 610px), (min-width: 900px) calc(44.48vw + 68px), (min-width: 780px) calc(8vw + 604px), calc(84.35vw + 23px)\" srcset=\"https://dmdh.me/media/posts/11/responsive/Snipaste_2026-09-13_04-13-42-xs.png 300w ,https://dmdh.me/media/posts/11/responsive/Snipaste_2026-09-13_04-13-42-sm.png 480w ,https://dmdh.me/media/posts/11/responsive/Snipaste_2026-09-13_04-13-42-md.png 768w\"></figure>\n<p>写到这里，这篇作为英语作业的周记，也就成了博客里的一篇小文章。<br><br>就这样把最近的我记录下来吧。<br><br><br></p>",
